    "spec": "The registration date must fall on a business day. This applies to the EFFECTIVE registration date, whether it was supplied in the request or defaulted to the server date: when that date is a Saturday or Sunday, roll it forward to the next Monday and use that as 'registrationDate'. This changes existing behaviour: a supplied weekend date is now rolled forward too, any value derived from the registration date (such as the membership number's year segment) must use the adjusted date, and the daily create-limit must count owners per adjusted business day.",
    "prompt": "Implement the following change to the application so that it fully satisfies\nthe specification and all existing and new tests pass. Run the test suite and\nmake it green before finishing.\n\nThe registration date must fall on a business day. This applies to the EFFECTIVE registration date, whether it was supplied in the request or defaulted to the server date: when that date is a Saturday or Sunday, roll it forward to the next Monday and use that as 'registrationDate'. This changes existing behaviour: a supplied weekend date is now rolled forward too, any value derived from the registration date (such as the membership number's year segment) must use the adjusted date, and the daily create-limit must count owners per adjusted business day.\n"
  },
